ent. With\n`ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`, the parent component's CD cycle never fires, so Angular\nnever re-renders the projected detail content."],[3576,"**Root cause:** `PoDynamicFormBaseComponent` declares only one `@Output`: `outputs: \\{ formOutput: \"p-form\" \\}`.\nThere is no `p-value-change` output. Angular silently ignores unknown event bindings — no error, no warning."],[3759,"**Root cause:** `PoTableDetail.columns` usa o tipo interno `PoTableDetailColumn`, subconjunto de\n`PoTableColumn` que &#x2A;*não inclui `width`**. `width` só é válido em colunas master."],[3649,"**Root cause:** Angular's signal auto-unwrapping only works in **Angular-owned template\ncontexts** (built-in directives, Angular's own components with the same signal runtime).\nPO-UI components read `@Input()` values imperatively via `this.breadcrumb.items` inside\ntheir own lifecycle hooks — they receive the Signal function object itself if `()` was omitted."],[3762,"**Root cause:** Colunas sem `type` específico são renderizadas como `string` — sem alinhamento nem formatação automática."],[3714,"**Root cause:** po-table adds an internal selectable-column (`po-table-column-selectable`)\nof **56px** that is NOT represented in `PoTableColumn[]`. This hidden 56px pushes the table\nwider than its container."],[3750,"**Root cause:** po-table adiciona a linha ao seu `selectedRows` interno **antes** de despachar o evento\n`(p-selected)`. Qualquer mudança síncrona em `$selected: false` é processada no mesmo ciclo de CD —\nmas o estado interno do po-table já tem a linha, então a desincronia persiste."],[3574,"**Root cause:** The correct Angular input alias is `p-maxlength` (no hyphen between `max` and `length`)."],[275,"**Scripts de tooling**"],[3424,"**Se o projeto não usar o interceptor do plugin**, implementar manualmente:"],[227,"**SEC**"],[311,"**Segurança**"],[1319,"**Seleção de template** — carrega `templates-test-base.md` + `templates-test-<família>.md`"],[1513,"**Seletor:** `po-page-dyn